 owitz/Finley Lecture Hall\n\n About \n\n Register here if attending online
    Gabrielle Kaufmann-Kohler is Professor Emerita at Geneva University La
 w School and founder\, former director\, and a current faculty member of t
 he Geneva LL.M. in International Dispute Settlement (MIDS). She is also a 
 Visiting Professor at different universities\, including National Universi
 ty of Singapore\, Tsinghua University in Beijing\, Sciences Po Paris\, and
  a frequent lecturer in all regions of the world.\n She is a Founding Part
 ner of LKK Arbitration (formerly Lévy Kaufmann-Kohler)\, where she practi
 ces international investment and commercial arbitration\, and in the past 
 also sports arbitration. She has acted in over 280 international arbitrati
 ons\, mainly as arbitrator and predominantly as chair. S
